    "en": {
      "name": "Ikuta Ryokuchi",
      "description": "Ikuta Ryokuchi Park (生田緑地, Ikuta Ryokuchi) is a park in Tama-ku, Kawasaki, Kanagawa Prefecture, Japan. \nAmong other features, it has an observation platform at the top of Mt. Masugata, the Japan Open-Air Folk Museum with authentic traditional houses, the Kawasaki Municipal Science Museum with a planetarium, the Taro Okamoto Museum of Art, a traditional craft center, and a large rose garden open to the public in the spring and autumn.",
      "highlights": ["Culture"]
    },
    "ja": {
      "name": "生田緑地",
      "description": "生田緑地（いくたりょくち）は、神奈川県川崎市多摩区枡形、東生田、長尾、および宮前区初山にある都市公園（総合公園）である。\nなお、桝形山（ますがたやま）及び飯室山（いいむろやま）の大部分は生田緑地内に含まれている。",
      "highlights": ["展望"]
    }
  },
